&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;Hi stranger,

This is my script with Exponencial moving average in my scales ( 21,55,100,200) which I use, and Simple moving average (30,200).

Enjoy
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
